āhīma","f":["M","GEN"],"l":178},{"e":"٥١","v":"15:51"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"15:32","t":"[Allāh] said, \"O Iblees, what is [the matter] with you that you are not with those who prostrate?\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"15:33","t":"He said, \"Never would I prostrate to a human whom You created out of clay from an altered black mud.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"15:34","t":"[Allāh] said, \"Then depart from it, for indeed, you are expelled.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"15:35","t":"And indeed, upon you is the curse until the Day of Recompense.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"15:36","t":"He said, \"My Lord, then reprieve me until the Day they are resurrected.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"15:37","t":"[Allāh] said, \"So indeed, you are of those reprieved","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"15:38","t":"Until the Day of the time well-known.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"15:39","t":"[Iblees] said, \"My Lord, because You have put me in error, I will surely make [disobedience] attractive to them [i.e., mankind] on earth, and I will mislead them all","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"15:40","t":"Except, among them, Your chosen servants.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"15:41","t":"[Allāh] said, \"This is a path [of return] to Me [that is] straight.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"15:42","t":"Indeed, My servants - no authority will you have over them, except those who follow you of the deviators.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"15:43","t":"And indeed, Hell is the promised place for them all.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"15:44","t":"It has seven gates; for every gate is of them [i.e., Satan's followers] a portion designated.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"15:45","t":"Indeed, the righteous will be within gardens and springs,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"15:46","t":"[Having been told], \"Enter it in peace, safe [and secure].\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"15:47","t":"And We will remove whatever is in their breasts of resentment, [so they will be] brothers, on thrones facing each other.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"15:48","t":"No fatigue will touch them therein, nor from it will they [ever] be removed.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"15:49","t":"[O Muḥammad], inform My servants that it is I who am the Forgiving, the Merciful,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"15:50","t":"And that it is My punishment which is the painful punishment.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"15:51","t":"And inform them about the guests of Abraham,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[15],"sajdah":false}